{"name":"Setle","dev":"Eli Levin","keys":["ios:6801995128"],"ios":{"id":"6801995128","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/setle/id6801995128?uo=4","rating":5,"ratings":9,"price":"Free","genre":"Games","screens":["https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/bd/06/54/bd065475-feed-b1c4-35fa-932b81d7b86c/Simulator_Screenshot_-_iPhone_17_Pro_Max_-_2026-08-17_at_21.31.26.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/a2/c9/df/a2c9df0b-015a-e3c3-2b4e-5760194bf1ee/Simulator_Screenshot_-_iPhone_17_Pro_Max_-_2026-08-17_at_21.33.21.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/69/c3/38/69c338f2-72c2-2456-133e-ffbc3db15753/Simulator_Screenshot_-_iPhone_17_Pro_Max_-_2026-08-17_at_21.33.22__U00232.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/95/69/22/9569224c-727d-fa6b-066d-e374e4560218/Simulator_Screenshot_-_iPhone_17_Pro_Max_-_2026-08-17_at_21.31.29.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/b7/53/cf/b753cfce-7854-2d0f-0b29-b196f099f88c/Simulator_Screenshot_-_iPhone_17_Pro_Max_-_2026-08-17_at_21.36.56.png/320x480bb.jpg"],"desc":"Setle is the card game of pattern-spotting.\n\nEvery card carries four features — number, shape, shading, and color. Three cards make a match when each feature is all the same or all different across them. Easy to learn in a minute. Much harder to see quickly.\n\nFour ways to play:\nClassic — Work through the whole deck. The clock counts up, and your best time is the score to beat.\nDaily Puzzle — Ninety seconds on the same deck everyone else gets that day. Share how you did and compete with your friends!\nSprint — Ninety seconds & a fresh shuffle.\nTwo Player — Lay down the device and face off head-to-head!\n\nPlay Setle each day to sharpen your brain!","released":"2026-08-26","updated":"2026-09-04","icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/db/46/5d/db465dc7-5af6-8848-3716-3bff73